    "q-34980": {
      "dom_id": "step-q34980",
      "name": "Question 4",
      "problem": "Consider the matrix $A=[\\begin{aligned}2 & -7\\end{aligned}]$ and the vector $b=[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ k\\end{aligned}].$ Find the value of $k$ such that $b\\in \\text{Null}(A).$",
      "worked_solution": "If $b\\in \\text{Null}(A),$ then we must have $Ab=0.$ Substituting the given information, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}Ab & =0 \\\\ [\\begin{aligned}2 & -7\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ k\\end{aligned}] & =0 \\\\ -7k & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nand for this equation, we obtain $k=0.$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices": [
            {
              "option": "a",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-34980-a",
              "type": "math",
              "value": "\\frac{2}{7}",
              "html": "<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"82\" style=\"font-size: 119.6%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mfrac><mjx-frac type=\"d\"><mjx-num><mjx-nstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-nstrut><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-num><mjx-dbox><mjx-dtable><mjx-line type=\"d\"></mjx-line><mjx-row><mjx-den><mjx-dstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-dstrut><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c37\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-den></mjx-row></mjx-dtable></mjx-dbox></mjx-frac></mjx-mfrac></mjx-mstyle></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>7</mn></mfrac></mstyle></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>"
            },
            {
